    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Potato</strong> is an exciting low-poly parkour game where every level challenges your skills and patience. After a catastrophic collision of universes, the boundaries between worlds have blurred, merging fantastical landscapes into one unique reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>&quot;Potato&quot;</strong>\u2014a brave and funny potato stranded far from home. To return, Potato must overcome various obstacles and master parkour skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you'll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting levels with unique obstacles and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful low-poly visuals that create a mysterious atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling parkour mechanics where speed, agility, and precision are key.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Potato find its way back home? Embark on this captivating adventure and put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Simple controls that anyone can master.<br>\u2714 Perfect for parkour enthusiasts.<br>\u2714 Suitable for both casual players and hardcore gamers..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very easy? Try parkour in Anomaly mode, where you will encounter additional difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479690/extras/4f6fc92a2abb4cdf7c7146df7e4c096a.avif?t=1742401990\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of customization, you have a unique opportunity to decorate your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479690/extras/668b8cf4c0759c37bae98e4ada105e38.avif?t=1742401990\" data-has-big width=800 height=518 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Potato escape the chaos of the worlds by overcoming obstacles and discovering secrets!</p>",
